#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introdución"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&ark; is a program for managing various archive formats within the &kde; "
#| "environment. Archives can be viewed, extracted, created and modified from "
#| "within &ark;. The program can handle various formats such as "
#| "<command>tar</command>, <command>gzip</command>, <command>bzip2</"
#| "command>, <command>zip</command>, <command>rar</command> and "
#| "<command>lha</command> (if appropriate command-line programs are "
#| "installed)."
msgid ""
"&ark; is a program for viewing, extracting, creating and modifying archives. "
"&ark; can handle various archive formats such as <command>tar</command>, "
"<command>gzip</command>, <command>bzip2</command>, <command>zip</command>, "
"<command>rar</command>, <command>7zip</command>, <command>xz</command>, "
"<command>rpm</command>, <command>cab</command> and <command>deb</command> "
"(support for certain archive formats depends on the appropriate command-line "
"programs being installed)."
msgstr ""
"O &ark; é un programa para xestionar diversos formatos de arquivos dentro do "
"ambiente do &kde;. Pódense ver, extraer, crear e modificar os arquivos "
"dentro do ambiente do &kde;. O programa pode tratar diversos formatos, como "
"o <command>tar</command>, o <command>gzip</command>, o <command>bzip2</"
"command>, o <command>zip</command> e o <command>lla</command> (se estiveren "
"instalados os programas axeitados da liña de comandos)."

